      "name": "Fundo Dona de Mim Microcredit Program",
      "description": "Microcredit program for female entrepreneurs in the Jequitinhonha Valley region, in partnership with Grupo Mulheres do Brasil. 730 female entrepreneurs enrolled with plans to expand to 10,000. Loans of R$2,000 per person with mentorship programs.",
      "url": "https://sigmalithiumcorp.com/social/"
    },
    {
      "name": "Zero Drought Program",
      "description": "Construction of rainwater capture structures in the local municipalities of Araçuaí and Itinga to support small-scale farmers during drought periods.",
      "url": "https://sigmalithiumcorp.com/social/"
    },
    {
      "name": "Homecoming Employment Program (Volta ao Lar)",
      "description": "Program to bring back qualified workforce that migrated out of the region. Approximately 85% of workforce is comprised of Vale do Jequitinhonha region locals.",
      "url": "https://sigmalithiumcorp.com/social/"
    },
    {
      "name": "Water for All Program",
      "description": "Provides drinking water to households through partnership with municipalities of Araçuaí and Itinga, donating water tanks and funding water deliveries by truck.",
      "url": "https://sigmalithiumcorp.com/social/"
    },
    {
      "name": "Education that Transforms Program",
      "description": "Education initiatives for children, adolescents and adults. Renovation and expansion of three municipal public schools. Post-basic education courses, environmental awareness classes, cultural and sports education.",
